          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>The population standard deviation $\\sigma = 677$ is known, so use the $z$ interval: margin $= z_{0.025}\\frac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{n}} = 1.96 \\times \\frac{677}{\\sqrt{40}} = 1.96 \\times 107.04 = 209.8$. CI $= 3120 \\pm 209.8 = (2910.2,\\ 3329.8) \\approx (2910, 3330)$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Vì biết độ lệch chuẩn tổng thể $\\sigma = 677$ nên dùng khoảng $z$: biên sai số $= z_{0.025}\\frac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{n}} = 1.96 \\times \\frac{677}{\\sqrt{40}} = 1.96 \\times 107.04 = 209.8$. Khoảng tin cậy $= 3120 \\pm 209.8 = (2910.2,\\ 3329.8) \\approx (2910, 3330)$.</p></div>"
